title The verb already in my hand
prompt Agreed, approve -- build Rishi's native text primitives.
think I WAS APPROVED TO BUILD A THING THAT ALREADY EXISTED, AND CHECKING TOOK UNDER A MINUTE. Rishi's own module header declares read-file, lines, where, length, contains, starts-with, ends-with, trim, slice, join and map, and has for far longer than this session. A three-line Rishi script counting the roster's guard lines answers 453 in ONE process where the shell form answers 453 in TWO. The primitive I recommended and Keaton approved was in the header of the file I was about to edit.
think So the lap turned from building to reading, and the finding is better than the build would have been: the harness's cost is a HABIT rather than a language gap. It reaches for an outside tool while holding the operation in its hand.
think THE SHARPER HALF IS THAT SHELL WAS HOLDING IT TOO, which is what keeps this from being a Rishi-migration argument. The 916 grep spawns left in standing_equipment_scan.sh sat at three sites, each a membership test inside a loop, and POSIX shell answers membership with case against a newline-delimited variable. The set is built in the loop that already writes the file, so it costs nothing.
obs THE ARC OVER ONE FILE, ONE LAP: 4,330 processes and 20,641ms, to 974 and 3,583ms after the field split, to 45 and 531ms after the membership test. THIRTY-NINE TIMES FASTER with every byte of its answer held exactly. grep and awk both reach zero in their loops; the 45 that remain are mktemp, sed, sort and head outside any loop.
obs THE BYTE-IDENTITY CHECK NEARLY GAVE A FALSE ALARM, and the method lesson outlives the repair. Comparing the new output against a baseline captured earlier read DIFFERENT at runs_seconds_total and newest_run -- both readings OF the run card, which a guard run in between had rewritten. The input had moved rather than the logic. The honest form runs BOTH versions against the SAME input in the same moment, stash and unstash, and that read identical. A before-and-after comparison measures the change plus everything else that moved.
obs The essay graded B+ at 88 with register 66, which STANDS under the quality rule, and a sweep of nine sentences leading with what is took it to A at 92 with register 82 -- 18 percent negatives, under the Door ceiling let alone Field's.
